      "date": "2026-05-16T20:01:33.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings: EPS exceeds analyst expectations",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹60.34 (up from ₹54.96 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹50.6b (up 12% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹2.78b (up 12% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 5.5% (in line with FY 2025). Revenue was in line with analyst estimates. Earnings per share (EPS) surpassed analyst estimates by 5.2%. Revenue is forecast to grow 11% p.a. on average during the next 2 years, compared to a 12% growth forecast for the Luxury industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 18% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 89% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
